The function is already minimal, so I only added a branch-prediction hint marking the invalid-profile/index path as cold, keeping the common valid lookup as fall-through and out of the hot path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```